    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Circuitborn (Salvage Line)</em> at level 17; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You are a workshop that learned to walk.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Mobile Facility Node (1/a Soma Break).</strong> Over 1 minute, deploy a temporary station (a glowing fold-out altar of tools) that lasts 10 minutes. While active, you and allies within 10 feet have reroll the lowest die on crafting, repairing, and disabling devices [TODO(adv-call)]. In BBTTCC strategic play, your faction may treat one <em>Repair Rig</em> or <em>Repair Facility</em> activity as costing 1 less OP once per Turn (GM / system).</p>",
